Package: sshguard-face
Version: 1.0.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-serial, systemd
Recommends: zenity, putty-tools
Maintainer: Martin ZBC <zbcmara52@zbc.dk>
Description: Face recognition SSH access control using HuskyLens
 sshGuard uses a HuskyLens camera module to detect authorized users
 and temporarily enables SSH access only when a recognized face is detected.
 .
 Features:
  - Face-based SSH access control
  - Per-user authorization (only detected user can log in)
  - SSH key-only authentication
  - AllowGroups restriction to sshGuard group
  - Strict mode: SSH only runs during detection windows
  - Desktop notifications via Zenity
 .
 Requires HuskyLens connected via UART to /dev/serial0.
Homepage: https://none.null
